/* Names never show ahead of their icon.
   Many types get their caption from a shared rule (e.g. [leisure], [amenity])
   that starts a zoom or two before the type's own icon, leaving a floating
   name. Hide the name until the icon appears. Region-scale area names
   (national parks, nature reserves, universities) are left alone. */

